# Oceanview — Cline Project Rules
# Read this before touching any file.

---

## Who else is working on this codebase

**Claude Code** is the primary coding agent on this project. This `.clinerules` file is kept
up-to-date by Claude Code so Cline always knows the current state of work.

---

## Tech stack (do not change these without asking)

- React 18 + Vite 6 — JSX, ES modules, no TypeScript
- Routing: hash-based state in `src/components/Page.jsx` — no react-router, no URL changes
- Styling: **inline JS style objects** + `src/styles/tokens.css` — NO Tailwind, NO CSS modules
- All CSS custom properties live in `tokens.css` — use them (`var(--ov-navy-900)`, etc.)
- Build: `npm run build` → `dist/`  |  Dev: `npm run dev`
- Deploy: GitHub Pages via `.github/workflows/deploy.yml`

---

## File conventions

### Adding a new page
1. Create `src/components/MyPage.jsx`
2. Import it in `src/components/Page.jsx`
3. Add the route slug to `PAGE_ROUTES` set
4. Add a `case "my-page":` to the `renderPage()` switch
5. Add a page title to the `titles` map

### Styling rules
- Use inline `style={{}}` objects for component-specific styles
- Define a top-level `const S = { ... }` object with shared style fragments
- Use `className` only for responsive breakpoint helpers (e.g. `ov-about-grid`)
- Responsive classes live in `src/styles/tokens.css` under labeled sections
- Never use `!important` except inside media query overrides in `tokens.css`

### Component patterns
- `Eyebrow` from `./common.jsx` — renders the blue-dash + uppercase label
- `PillMint` / `PillNavy` / `PillGhost` / `TextLink` from `./Buttons.jsx`
- `PageHero` — takes `image`, `eyebrow`, `title`, `titleAccent`, `subtitle`, `ctaPrimary`, `onPrimary`
- `CTABanner` — inline CTA band (eyebrow + heading + body + button)
- `CTAPanel` — soft-tint "Get Started" band

### Design tokens (key ones)
```
Fonts:    var(--ov-ff-display)   PP Editorial New (headings)
          var(--ov-ff-sans)      PP Mori (body/UI)
Navy:     #001F54  #0D1F4E  #1A3070  #233D7C
Teal:     #70BABF  #2494C1  rgba(112,186,191,0.2)  ← teal card bg
Grey:     #4A5568  #6B7280
Surface:  #F1FBFF  (ov-surface-tint)
```

