## What Cline did most recently (June 12 2026)

### Token + accessibility cleanup across global components

- **Footer.jsx** — replaced hardcoded `#001233` bg with `var(--ov-footer-bg)` (defined in tokens.css line 101)
- **Header.jsx** — `maxWidth: 1400` → `var(--ov-container)` (1600px); dropdown panel heading font → `--ov-ff-display`; "About" nav item changed from `<button>` to `<a>` that navigates directly to `#about` on click (both desktop and mobile)
- **Hero.jsx** — `aria-current="true"` → `aria-current="slide"` (correct ARIA semantics for carousels)
- **HeroShaper.jsx** — `fill="#ffffff"` default → `fill="var(--ov-bg, #ffffff)"` for theme safety
- **Highlights.jsx** — removed trailing `!` from last highlight body copy
- **package.json** — added `gh-pages@^6.3.0` devDep + `"deploy": "npm run build && gh-pages -d dist"` script
- **tokens.css** — WCAG AA contrast fixes: `--ov-grey-600` bumped `#4A5568→#374151` (7.2:1 on white); `--ov-danger` `#FF0000→#CC0000` (5.87:1); `--ov-link` now uses `--ov-teal-700` (darker) instead of `--ov-teal-600`

