## Things NOT to do

- Do not install Tailwind CSS or any CSS framework
- Do not add TypeScript or change file extensions to `.tsx`
- Do not use react-router or change the hash routing approach
- Do not modify `package.json` dependencies without asking
- Do not create standalone CSS files per component — all responsive overrides go in `tokens.css`
- Do not use `document.title` directly in components — page titles are set in `Page.jsx`'s useEffect
- Do not change the `base` path in `vite.config.js` (it's `/oceanview/` for GitHub Pages)
- Do not add comments explaining what the code does — only add comments for non-obvious WHY

